    "title": "Clarendon County elections board formally announces new director - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago MANNING, S.C. (WIS) - The Board of Registration and Elections of Clarendon County announced the appointment of Susan Thomas as its new director. Thomas was selected as director during the board’s meeting on Oct. 13. The board also decided Thomas’s annual salary will be $57,000 with $5,200 awarded between 90 and 180 days from the hire date. Read full article\n1",
